    <bpmn:process id="W_W1539" name="W1539. Installation Service Post-Completion Quality Inspection, Customer Sign-Off &amp; Punch List Resolution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Installation service completion (W138) reported by installation partner
Frequency: ~2,200–3,500 installations/month across all stores (per the 500–800/week basis)
Volume: Particularly relevant for aircon installation, water heater installation, tile/flooring installation
Owner: Service Coordinator Lead
Participants: Service Coordinator, Installation Partner Technician, Customer, Store Manager
Source: workflow W1539 — Installation Service Post-Completion Quality Inspection, Customer Sign-Off &amp; Punch List Resolution</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1539_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1539_Lane1" name="Installation Partner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1539_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1539_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1539_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1539_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1539_Lane2" name="Service Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1539_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1539_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1539_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1539_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1539_Lane4" name="Service Coordinator Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1539_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1539_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1539_Start6" name="Installation service completion (W138) reported by installation partner">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1539_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1539_Task7" name="Installation completion notification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Installation completion notification: Installation Partner Technician reports job completion via partner mobile app — uploads before/after photos, notes any issues encountered, confirms materials used match the original service order
Responsible (R): Installation Partner
Accountable (A): Service Coordinator
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1539_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1539_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1539_Task8" name="Quality checklist verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Quality checklist verification: Service Coordinator reviews submitted photos against quality checklist for the service type — e.g., for aircon: mounting stability, pipe insulation, drainage flow test, electrical connection safety, thermostat function test, area cleanup; for tile installation: alignment, grout line consistency, waterproofing membrane integrity, surface cleanliness
Responsible (R): Service Coordinator
Accountable (A): Service Coordinator Lead
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1539_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1539_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1539_Task9" name="Customer walkthrough &amp; sign-off">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Customer walkthrough &amp; sign-off: Installation Partner conducts walkthrough with customer; demonstrates installed product functionality; customer inspects and either (a) signs off on completion (digital signature on partner app), or (b) identifies punch list items
Responsible (R): Installation Partner / Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1539_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1539_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1539_Task10" name="Punch list management">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Punch list management (if applicable): If customer identifies deficiencies, Installation Partner creates punch list with item descriptions and photos; commits to resolution timeline (minor items: 24–48 hours, major items: 3–5 business days); Service Coordinator tracks punch list status; escalates overdue items to Store Manager
Responsible (R): Service Coordinator
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 5–10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1539_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1539_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1539_Task11" name="Punch list resolution &amp; final sign-off">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Punch list resolution &amp; final sign-off: Installation Partner returns to resolve punch list items; uploads completion photos; customer provides final sign-off; system closes service order with full documentation
Responsible (R): Installation Partner / Customer
Accountable (A): Service Coordinator
Duration: Varies</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1539_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1539_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1539_Task12" name="Post-installation survey">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Post-installation survey: System sends automated customer satisfaction survey (CSAT/NPS) 48 hours after final sign-off — installation quality, technician professionalism, timeliness, overall satisfaction; negative responses (&lt; 7/10) trigger Service Coordinator follow-up call within 24 hours (W87)
Responsible (R): System / Service Coordinator
Accountable (A): Service Coordinator Lead
Duration: 5 min (auto) + 15 min (negative follow-up)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1539_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1539_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1539_Task13" name="Monthly partner quality review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Monthly partner quality review: Service Coordinator Lead compiles monthly quality report per installation partner — completion rate, punch list frequency, average punch list resolution time, customer satisfaction score, warranty callback rate; feeds into partner performance review (W213)
Responsible (R): Service Coordinator Lead
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: 4 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1539_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1539_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1539_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1539_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1539_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-275 (ensure controlled execution — Installation &amp; Repair Services (PA-12.1).) | - operational: Service Coordinator Lead review and approval gate
Owner: Service Coordinator Lead</bpmn:text>
